AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
The operator runs the task with --root NAR-WHITEBOARD-VIEW and reads the
view system's decisions, mechanisms, rules and work in the same page shape
as the semantic-layer whiteboard, combs them, and edits by changing rows or
filing nodes in this plan. The renderer, the wireline and the check are the
same programs that rendered the whiteboard.
<<<
